			"notes": "- Added Glow Sheep.  \n  - 1/128 chance of being a \"Glow Sheep\" when the sheep is spawned.  \n  - Sheep can become \"Glow Sheep\" by using a glow ink sac on them.  \n- Added Glow Wool.  \n  - Dropped by \"Glow Sheep\" when killed or sheared.  \n  - Craftable using Glow Ink Sac and Wool.  \n  - Using Glow Ink Sac on Wool will convert it into it's glow variant.  \n- Added Glow Carpet.  \n  - Craftable using Glow Wool.  \n  - Craftable using Glow Ink Sac and Carpet.  \n  - Using Glow Ink Sac on Carpet will convert it into it's glow variant.  \n\n\n*This was made in one day (25/10/2024) for [ModFest 1.21](https://modfest.net/1.21).*"
